    {
      "id": "516d731e-ded3-42a2-a160-afeefcdaacfb",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "281d4d98-d4a9-4b35-a934-751d9b2577a3",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The sled register\nlists the city as\nowner. Its repair\ncharge was",
                "paid from a public\nfund. Storage is\nthe only unpaid\nitem. A penciled",
                "note says\nequipment cannot\nbe pledged by a\ndriver. Moxie\nlooks",
                "deeply relieved by\nthis detail."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f448ddb7-4bcd-4147-a6d0-5696564af13e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b9b8f2d5-d722-437b-a975-d357923105ba",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The release\nchecklist requires\ntwo facts: public\nownership and a",
                "cleared repair\ncharge. The\nsorting register\nproves ownership;\nthe",
                "paid repair line\nproves the charge\ncleared. The\nstorage dispute",
                "belongs on a\nseparate account.\nA substitute form\noffers release if",
                "Moxie signs a\npersonal loan. She\ncould sign\nquickly, but it\nwould",
                "turn a public\npaperwork error\ninto her private\ndebt. She puts the",
                "pen down."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9d032f4c-28d8-463d-a5f0-8289e9c37f4d",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "d261b1ce-0d95-4ac8-a1ac-1012422ab3b0",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Manifest: Vehicle\nloan: none. Repair\ndebt: cleared.\nStorage claim:",
                "disputed. Release\nrequires the\nmunicipal owner\nmark, a square.\nThe",
                "crown stamp would\ntransfer a private\nvehicle, which\nthis sled has",
                "never been."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "51348095-d8cc-42f1-a5f7-94ef9a6cce34",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "34dc9f66-a733-4769-a2ea-d2cfef3e9cd7",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Select the release\nform appropriate\nto this sled\nownership. The\nmark",
                "is specified in\nthe manifest."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1ec2da0-0efa-4e1f-aabf-8eac0ed28b85",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "9a0cb6bb-ebc0-477c-a399-59b4b64fe88f",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which packet\nsatisfies the two\nrelease conditions\nwithout making",
                "Moxie personally\nliable? The clerk\ncan attach more\nthan one",
                "document. Do not\nsolve a missing\nproof by inventing\na new borrower.",
                "Moxie says she\nwill wait while\nyou get it right;\nthe sled belongs\nto",
                "the city, and so\ndoes the duty to\nkeep its records\nstraight."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a893c2e0-f630-450e-a6e2-187034ac5238",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "bcd22f4c-510a-4150-a6de-a6ddf8fb4eaa",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Moxie: We can use\nthe sled again\nwithout pretending\nthe storage bill",
                "disappeared. That\nis a surprisingly\ngrown up victory.\nShe writes",
                "REPAIR THE RUNNER\nbefore drawing a\nracing stripe. The\nstripe comes",
                "second, by a\nnarrow vote."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
